{title: 055 - Jesus, Tender Shepherd, Hear Me}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Worship}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[Cm/G]Jesus, [Bb]tender [Bb7]Shepherd, hear [Eb/Bb]me,
[Eb/G]Bless [Cm]Thy [Bb]little [Gm]lamb [F7/A]tonight;
[Cm/G]Through [Eb]the darkness be [Bb7]Thou near me;
[Cm]Watch [Bb7/Ab]my [Gm]sleep [Ab]till morning [Bb/F]light.

Verse 2:
[Cm/G]All [Eb/Bb]this [Bb]day Thy [Bb7]hand has led [Eb/Bb]me,
[Eb/G]And [Cm]I [Bb]thank [Bb7/Ab]Thee [Gm]for [F7/A]Thy care;
[Cm/G]Thou [Eb]hast clothed [Bb/F]me, [Eb]warmed [Bb7]and fed me;
[Cm]Listen [Gm]to [Ab]my evening [Cm/G]prayer.
